    "title": "What Is RAG in AI? Retrieval-Augmented Generation Explained",
    "excerpt": "RAG lets an AI model answer from your own documents. Learn how it works, see a small Python example, and know when to use it.",
    "category": "AI",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
    "author": "Aakash Singh Rajput",
