    "title": "What Is a Smart Contract? Simple Explanation With Examples",
    "excerpt": "A smart contract is a program on a blockchain that runs exactly as written. Learn how smart contracts work, see real code, and know the risks.",
    "category": "Blockchain",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
    "author": "Aakash Singh Rajput",
    "image": "/blogs/generated/what-is-a-smart-contract.svg",
    "imageAlt": "Illustration for the article: What Is a Smart Contract? Simple Explanation With Examples",
