    "id": "how-to-become-blockchain-developer",
    "title": "How to Become a Blockchain Developer: A Step-by-Step Roadmap",
    "excerpt": "A practical roadmap to become a blockchain developer. Skills to learn in order, tools, projects to build, and how to get your first job.",
    "category": "Blockchain",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
    "author": "Aakash Singh Rajput",
    "image": "/blogs/generated/how-to-become-blockchain-developer.svg",
    "imageAlt": "Illustration for the article: How to Become a Blockchain Developer: A Step-by-Step Roadmap",
