    "id": "prompt-engineering-guide",
    "title": "Prompt Engineering Guide: 10 Techniques That Actually Work",
    "excerpt": "Ten prompt engineering techniques with before and after examples. Write clear prompts, get the format you want, and reduce wrong answers.",
