    "id": "fine-tuning-vs-rag",
    "title": "Fine-Tuning vs RAG: Which One Should You Use?",
    "excerpt": "RAG adds knowledge to the prompt. Fine-tuning changes the model. Compare cost, speed, and results, and use a simple checklist to choose.",
    "category": "AI",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
