    "title": "What Is DeFi? Decentralized Finance Explained for Beginners",
    "excerpt": "DeFi offers lending, trading, and earning without banks, using smart contracts. Learn how it works, the main apps, and the real risks.",
    "category": "Blockchain",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
