    "id": "what-are-embeddings",
    "title": "What Are Embeddings in AI? Meaning, Examples, and Uses",
    "excerpt": "Embeddings turn text into numbers that hold its meaning. Learn how they work, how to create them in Python, and where they are used.",
    "category": "AI",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
