    "title": "Bitcoin vs Ethereum: Key Differences Explained Simply",
    "excerpt": "Bitcoin is digital money with a fixed supply. Ethereum is a platform for apps and smart contracts. Compare purpose, speed, supply, and security.",
    "category": "Blockchain",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
