    "id": "run-local-llm-ollama",
    "title": "How to Run a Local LLM With Ollama: Step-by-Step Setup",
    "excerpt": "Run an AI model on your own computer for free with Ollama. Install it, pick a model for your RAM, and call it from Python.",
    "category": "AI",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
    "author": "Aakash Singh Rajput",
