    "title": "How to Create an ERC-20 Token: Step-by-Step With Solidity",
    "excerpt": "Create your own crypto token on Ethereum. Write an ERC-20 contract with OpenZeppelin, test it, deploy to a test network, and verify the code.",
    "category": "Blockchain",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
    "author": "Aakash Singh Rajput",
    "image": "/blogs/generated/create-erc20-token.svg",
    "imageAlt": "Illustration for the article: How to Create an ERC-20 Token: Step-by-Step With Solidity",
