    "id": "solidity-memory-vs-calldata-vs-storage",
    "title": "Solidity memory vs calldata vs storage: When to Use Each",
    "excerpt": "Storage is permanent, memory is temporary, calldata is read-only input. Learn the rules, the gas costs, and the copy-or-reference traps.",
