    "title": "Reentrancy Attack Explained: Solidity Example and Prevention",
    "excerpt": "A reentrancy attack lets a contract call back into your function before it finishes. See a vulnerable contract, the exploit, and three fixes.",
    "category": "Blockchain",
    "date": "November 11, 2026",
    "author": "Aakash Singh Rajput",
