    "title": "Hardhat vs Foundry: Which Solidity Framework Should You Use?",
    "excerpt": "Foundry tests in Solidity and is very fast. Hardhat uses JavaScript or TypeScript. Compare testing, fuzzing, speed, and how to use both.",
    "category": "Blockchain",
