    "title": "Regex Tutorial and Cheat Sheet: Regular Expressions Made Simple",
    "excerpt": "Learn regular expressions step by step. Character classes, quantifiers, groups, and lookarounds, with examples in JavaScript and Python.",
    "category": "Coding",
