    "id": "clean-code-solid-principles",
    "title": "Clean Code and SOLID Principles Explained With Examples",
    "excerpt": "Write code that is easy to read and change. Practical clean code rules and the five SOLID principles, each with a before and after example.",
    "category": "Coding",
